OL,3,GNEWSAEarly music festival nominated for
OL,4,Ainternational award
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Oxfordshire festival dedicated to
OL,7,Fmedieval, renaissance and baroque music
OL,8,Fhas been nominated for an international
OL,9,Faward.
OL,11,FThe Banbury Early Music Festival said
OL,12,Fits nomination for Audience Project of
OL,13,Fthe Year at the REMA Awards 2026
OL,14,Frepresented "a remarkable milestone for
OL,15,Fa festival established only three years
OL,16,Fago".
OL,18,FThis year's festival will take place on
OL,19,F26 and 27 September across the town
OL,20,Fcentre before the team travels to
OL,21,FBruges, Belgium, for the awards
OL,22,Fceremony on 25 November.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
