OL,3,GNEWSAEarly music festival nominated for
OL,4,Ainternational award
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe festival directors said that while
OL,7,Fearly music "can sometimes be perceived
OL,8,Fas something specialist or
OL,9,Finaccessible" they had always "wanted
OL,10,Fto break down that barrier".
